{"path":"index.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Aromatherapy Sessions & VIP Day</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Practical aromatherapy sessions and custom blends. Safety-forward, evidence-aware aromatherapy for adults.">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/styles.css">
</head>
<body class="layout-clinic">
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="container">
      <a class="brand" href="/">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</a>
      <nav class="nav" id="nav">
        <a href="/services.html">Offerings</a>
        <a href="/blends.html">Blends</a>
        <a href="/shop.html">Shop</a>
        <a href="/about.html">About</a>
        <a href="/book.html" class="cta">Book a VIP Day</a>
      </nav>
      <button class="nav-toggle" id="navToggle" aria-label="Open menu">☰</button>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section id="hero" class="hero" style="background-image:url('assets/img/pattern.svg');">
      <div class="container hero-grid">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <h1>{{TAGLINE}}</h1>
          <p class="lead">A practical, safety-first approach to aromatherapy. Personalized sessions, custom blends, and a VIP Day to accelerate your wellbeing rituals.
          </p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a class="btn primary" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
            <a class="btn ghost" href="/services.html">View sessions</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <aside class="hero-aside">
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Quick info</h3>
            <p>{{PRACTITIONER_NAME}} in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} — appointments by request.</p>
            <p class="muted">Phone: <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a> • Email: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></p>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="ritual" class="section ritual container">
      <div class="split">
        <div>
          <h2>A simple ritual to begin</h2>
          <p>We prioritize clear, repeatable steps you can bring home. Each session includes a consultation, an aroma profile review, and a guided blending or diffusion ritual you can adapt for daily use.</p>
          <ol>
            <li>Ground: 2–3 deep breaths to orient the senses.</li>
            <li>Observe: note top, middle, base impressions without judgement.</li>
            <li>Blend: combine a safe dilution in a carrier and test on patch area.</li>
            <li>Practice: diffuse for 10–20 minutes in a well-ventilated room.
            </li>
          </ol>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Why ritual matters</h3>
          <p class="muted">Ritual creates structure—helping scent associations form reliably. We keep instructions practical and backed by safety best practices (no medical claims).</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="what_to_expect" class="section what-to-expect">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>What to expect in a session</h2>
        <ul class="expect-list">
          <li><strong>30–90 minutes</strong> depending on depth — consultation and aroma sampling.</li>
          <li><strong>Safety review</strong> including skin sensitivity, medication considerations, and household pets.</li>
          <li><strong>Takeaway</strong> personalized notes, a labeled sample, and a follow-up plan.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="schedule" class="section schedule container">
      <h2>Schedule & session types</h2>
      <div class="cards">
        <article class="card">
          <h3>Intro Consult — 30 min</h3>
          <p class="price">$75</p>
          <p>Quick intake and scent profile to set safe preferences.</p>
          <a class="btn" href="/book.html">Book</a>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <h3>Full Session — 60–90 min</h3>
          <p class="price">$160</p>
          <p>Deep dive on needs, paperwork, blending and sample.</p>
          <a class="btn" href="/book.html">Reserve</a>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <h3>VIP Day — custom</h3>
          <p class="price">Custom</p>
          <p>Immersive day to design a full ritual library and workshop-style training.</p>
          <a class="btn primary" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">Inquire about VIP Day</a>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="pricing" class="section pricing container">
      <h2>Pricing snapshot</h2>
      <p class="muted">Transparent fees, optional add-ons like pre-made roll-ons or a small diffuser kit.</p>
      <table class="pricing-table">
        <thead><tr><th>Service</th><th>Length</th><th>Price</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>Intro Consult</td><td>30 min</td><td>$75</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Full Session</td><td>60–90 min</td><td>$160</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Blends Kit (starter)</td><td>—</td><td>$45</td></tr>
          <tr><td>VIP Day</td><td>Custom</td><td>Contact for rate</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </section>

    <section id="faq" class="section faq container">
      <h2>FAQ</h2>
      <div class="accordion" id="faqAcc">
        <div class="item">
          <button class="q">How do you dilute essential oils safely?</button>
          <div class="a">Recommended dilutions are given per-session and are typically 1–3% for adults. We discuss carrier oils and low-volume testing; do not apply undiluted essential oils to skin. This is general guidance, not medical advice.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="item">
          <button class="q">What is a patch test and why do it?</button>
          <div class="a">A patch test checks skin sensitivity: apply a diluted amount to the inner forearm and wait 24 hours for any reaction. We perform supervised patch tests when creating a topical blend.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="item">
          <button class="q">Are essential oils safe around pets?</button>
          <div class="a">Some oils are not safe for pets. We review household animals and recommend pet-safe usage, low concentrations, and avoiding closed-room exposure. Always consult your veterinarian for specific concerns.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="item">
          <button class="q">Is aromatherapy safe during pregnancy?</button>
          <div class="a">Pregnancy requires extra caution. We follow conservative guidelines and may avoid certain oils or recommend modifications. We do not provide medical advice—consult your healthcare provider if pregnant.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="cta" class="section cta container">
      <div class="cta-inner">
        <h2>Ready for a focused aromatherapy day?</h2>
        <p>Book a VIP Day for one-on-one immersion: practical training, a curated blend library, and take-home samples.</p>
        <a class="btn large primary" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="foot-grid">
        <div>
          <strong>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</strong>
          <p class="muted">{{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></p>
        </div>
        <nav>
          <a href="/privacy.html">Privacy</a>
          <a href="/pricing.html">Fees</a>
          <a href="/contact.html">Contact</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
      <small class="muted">© {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Aromatherapy. Safety-forward practices. Not a substitute for medical care.</small>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script src="assets/js/main.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>"} 
